            "value": "When on: the word shows only while the phone is held upright and auto-hides when laid flat. Triple-tap the eye button to force-show. Off by default."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启后：手机立起才显示词语，放平自动隐藏防偷看；连点眼睛按钮 3 次可强制显词。默认关闭。"
